claimed: okay-script-warm -- the second of the operator's four (2026-09-07), on §19's own finding: the first page of a process costs 870 ms because dotc warms up in it. Site.warm(): Vector[(String, Vector[String])] compiles every .md under root (variants and included fragments too, i18n/ aside) WITHOUT invoking, answering each page's compile errors -- so a start says which page is broken instead of the first visitor finding out; Page gains warm(). Plus Site.stats (a Stats value: renders, compiles, static, 304s, refusals, 404s, 500s, pages held, sessions) and Site.opsRoutes serving /healthz, /stats (JSON) and /metrics (Prometheus text, a pure mapping like okay-ops' Prom, not a dependency on it) -- NOT chained into `routes` by default, a caller opts in. Serve warms always and mounts the ops routes when OKAY_OPS=1. Touches Site.scala, Page.scala, Serve.scala, specs, docs.
